[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   step_14: blind validation -- the tests that close the last loopholes.
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   The remaining critiques of the step_11-13 confirmation:
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   (a) the axis seed came from the TNO side
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   (b) the q<3.1/class-1 regime was inherited from Warsaw
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   (c) the 60 deg cap was data-chosen
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   This battery removes each:
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   B1  continuous statistic, no cap: Spearman rho between angular
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   distance to the axis and d_of on ALL class-1 CODE-only
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   Oort-spike comets (no q cut at all) -- and on the matched
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   subset.  A real localized structure must decay monotonically
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   with angle; the cap becomes irrelevant.
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   B2  permutation null: shuffle aphelion directions among the same
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   comets (preserves every marginal) -> empirical p for the
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   cap contrast, no Gaussian assumptions.
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   B3  look-elsewhere count: of the full-sky grid scan, how many
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   independent directions reach p <= the observed?  The honest
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   trials factor.
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   B4  split-half blind validation: derive the best axis on a random
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   half of the data, apply the cap-60 d_of test to the held-out
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   half, repeat 500x.  If the structure is real, held-out p is
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   small AND the recovered axes cluster at the TNO direction --
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   axis and significance derived on data that never met.
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   B5  reverse cross-validation: evaluate the Warsaw discovery
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   statistic (d_so, full-arc) at the CODE-recovered axis
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   (lam 10, beta -20) -- symmetric confirmation: each catalogue
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   predicts the other's anomaly.
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   B6  all-class-1 no-q-cut cap test: the matched-regime criterion
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   dropped entirely -- does the signal survive losing the
[2026-09-20 10:45:33 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 037]   Warsaw-inherited cut?
